      "quoted_text": "Like clockwork.",
      "quoted_author": "Davis #BBN #PorVida",
      "quoted_handle": "iAmDavis2093"
    },
    {
      "id": "2125090079773462720",
      "text": "End 3Q. Some of the Spurs 92, Kings 74. Castle: 23-6-9 Champagnie: 20 points. Vassell has also come alive after half, with 14 points after a tough shooting start.",
